<section class="shell principles" id="approach"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">03 / HOW I WORK</p><h2>Build for people, <span class="soft-text">not just pixels.</span></h2></div><p>A simple process keeps the work grounded in real needs and measurable outcomes.</p></div><div class="principle-grid"><article><span class="principle-no">01 — UNDERSTAND</span><h3>Start with the question</h3><p>Research the audience, search behavior and problem before choosing the technology or designing a screen.</p></article><article><span class="principle-no">02 — STRUCTURE</span><h3>Make information useful</h3><p>Build a clear content structure, accessible navigation and components that stay consistent as a product grows.</p></article><article><span class="principle-no">03 — IMPROVE</span><h3>Measure and refine</h3><p>Ship a focused version, observe how it performs and improve speed, clarity and usefulness over time.</p></article></div></section>